<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Smithfield Foods started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Smithfield Foods started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it has initiated coverage of Smithfield Foods Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- In a release dated November 25, Stephens said the stock is expected to be a market performer.  It said structural changes in the pork industry are creating growth opportunities, but the near-term fundamental outlook for pork processors remains difficult as hog supplies are tight.</p>
<p>--Smithfield Foods traded off 7/8 at 33-1/2.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
